WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.840
As you know, this week we are celebrating beauty

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.770
both inside and out.

3
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.350
And something I truly cherish in my life

4
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.800
are all of my beautiful relationships.

5
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.060
And I find that one of the best ways

6
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.410
to nourish those relationships

7
00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.320
is with a handwritten card.

8
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:21.150
And so I thought I'd reach out to a few past guests,

9
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:25.760
and I got to team up with Hallmark to make it happen.

10
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.534
I love Hallmark!

11
00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:29.710
Hallmark's real stories collection

12
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.890
is actually about all of life's moments.

13
00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.650 line:15%
And it doesn't have to be a holiday

14
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.570 line:15%
for you to buy and send a card to someone.

15
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.750 line:15%
This is a 365 opportunity to show support,

16
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.910
encouragement, and appreciation to someone

17
00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.720
you are just getting to know

18
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.190
or have loved your whole life and everyone in between.

19
00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.950
This is from the support collection

20
00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:55.590
and I wrote it to my friend Justin,

21
00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.120
and it says be as kind to yourself,

22
00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.240
as you are to everyone else.

23
00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:04.280
And I have to say, he is someone who has saved lives.

24
00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.050
That's how good he is to everyone else.

25
00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:11.670
He is 18 year old, Justin Gavin, from Brooklyn, New York.

26
00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.470
He saw a burning car on the street

27
00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.900
with a mother and her three children inside,

28
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.690
and without hesitation he risked his own life

29
00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:25.490
to pull each one of them out of that burning car

30
00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.340
into safety.

31
00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:29.790
We found out that you're a fan of the Brooklyn Nets

32
00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:32.290
and they wanted to say thank you too.

33
00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:33.760
So we have hooked you all up.

34
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.370
We're getting you season passes.

35
00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.630
I wrote, dearest Justin, I'm so excited

36
00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:41.210
for your season tickets to the Brooklyn Nets.

37
00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:42.610
Have so much fun... And remember...

38
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:45.880
be as good to you, as you are to everyone else.

39
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:46.840
Lots of love...

40
00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.210
Your friend Drew.

41
00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:51.103
I love it. Thank you, Drew. And I hope to see you soon.

42
00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:56.760
And this card is from the appreciation collection

43
00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.030
and it was totally my favorite.

44
00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:02.030
And I thought, hmm, who should I send this to?

45
00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:07.030
Oh, Jonah. Jonah Larson is a crochet prodigy

46
00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.870
and a good friend of mine.

47
00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.030
He authored his first book at 11

48
00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.660
and he helped create a new library

49
00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:16.000
in the Ethiopian village in which he was born.

50
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.470
He's since become a correspondent for the show

51
00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:22.810
and does so much, including book reviews.

52
00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:26.460 line:15%
This card says, I love you this much.

53
00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.090 line:15%
And it's got the cutest little dinosaur

54
00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.210 line:15%
and these beautiful metallic hearts.

55
00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.010 line:15%
And it just really spoke to me.

56
00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:36.140
So I sent it to my dear friend, Jonah Larson

57
00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:40.039
Dearest Jonah, it's true. I love you so very much.

58
00:02:40.039 --> 00:02:42.400
I can't wait to continue our journey together

59
00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.130
to do good in this world.

60
00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:47.960
You are my inspiration and the best partner ever.

61
00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.710
See you soon.

62
00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.120
Your friend, Drew.

63
00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:54.100
Thank you so much for this letter Drew. It made my day.

64
00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.640
But I want to thank you for being

65
00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:58.070
a really wonderful crochet friend of mine.

66
00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.070
Thank you so much, Drew.

67
00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.970
This is from their encouragement collection.

68
00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:07.750
And I thought, hmm, who should I send some encouragement to?

69
00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.370
I know my friend, Hailey, who was on our show

70
00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.900
with Carrie Underwood, and she has a very incredible program

71
00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.473
where she sells bracelets for good.

72
00:03:18.312 --> 00:03:20.650
I told my mom, I wanted to sell them

73
00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:23.570
and raise money for one of the hospitals.

74
00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.270
Because of our show, it upped her game.

75
00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.740
And she went from like a few thousand dollars

76
00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.670
to almost $50,000.

77
00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.340
So I wanted to encourage Hailey to keep going.

78
00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.800
Dearest Hailey, you are doing such important work

79
00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.310
and yet you are the sweetest young lady!

80
00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.840
And you are truly showing the power of what is possible.

81
00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.960
I am sending you lots of love

82
00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.250
and encouragement to keep you going.

83
00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.500
Your friend, Drew.

84
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.350
Drew Barrymore!

85
00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.660
Thank you so much for thinking of me.

86
00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:57.497
I love it. Your friend, Hailey.

87
00:03:57.497 --> 00:03:59.747
(applause)

88
00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:04.360
I can't handle the level of sweetness. I really can't.

89
00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.550
And starting today, Hallmark is giving away

90
00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:12.090
1 million cards to help you connect

91
00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.350
with those that you care about.

92
00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.160 line:15%
Go to hallmark.com/sharecaring

93
00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:23.160 line:15%
to request your free three card pack while supplies last.

94
00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.300
And BFFs, because we want you to make the people

95
00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:30.270
in your life feel special right away.

96
00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:35.190
You are all getting $50 Hallmark gift cards.

97
00:04:36.674 --> 00:04:39.387
So break out those pens and pour your heart out.

98
00:04:39.387 --> 00:04:41.970
(upbeat music)

